# Scoring

- Race types are `Handicap` (corrected time), `Pursuit` (finish position; the handicap is in the start), and `Level Rating` (finish position). Defined in `race-calendar/model/race-type.ts`.
- A scoring sheet is either time-based (`Handicap` and `Level Rating`) or position-based (`Pursuit` and `Level Rating`). Do not put `Pursuit` and `Handicap` on one sheet.
- Durations are stored in seconds. Display them with `DurationPipe`.
- Score a series by calling `score` from `app/scoring` (`scoring/services/scorer.ts`). It is a pure function. Do not reimplement points math in a component or a Cloud Function.
- `docs/scoring-logic.md` is the product spec. If it disagrees with `app/scoring`, the code is right; update the spec.
